# Start the resume profile

On the first reply in this project, read `.resume-memory/profile.json` if it exists.

If any field in `.agents/skills/best-fit-resume/references/questions.md` is empty, start now. Do not wait for the user to ask for a resume.

Say **Let's create your profile.** If some answers are already saved, say **Continuing your profile.**

Ask exactly one missing question, in the order in that file. Stop and wait.

After the answer, write it into `.resume-memory/profile.json` before asking the next question. Never drop a filled field. Never send the full question list in one message.

When the profile is complete, summarize it and ask whether to build the resume. Then follow `.agents/skills/best-fit-resume/SKILL.md`.
